      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is very important to me. When this bug was introduced I felt a lot of dizziness as a passenger even though I thought I would never experience dizziness in VR again. I can't get used to it, nor I should. I still feel very uncomfortable when I'm a passenger. And it makes me feel bad for my passengers when I'm a pilot.\nDear VRChat devs, please fix it.",
